  "decisions": [
    "SOL uses original sun branding, white editorial surfaces, cobalt #0041D9 actions, charcoal text, architectural photography, 12px buttons and 20px cards. User requested a premium original property experience inspired by the provided reference.",
    "Reuse existing shadcn Button and Base UI Tabs. Tab composition informed by https://21st.dev/originui/tabs; authenticated 21st CLI retrieval was unavailable.",
    "Render real Supabase listing data and preserve search, authentication, favorites, and import workflows. Never substitute editorial photography for listing photos.",
    "Buy page (/properties, 2026-10-02): Zillow-style split search with SOL tokens. Full-height mapcn/MapLibre map (CARTO Positron light) on the left, 2-column listing grid on the right, pill filter bar built on Base UI Popover, cobalt price pins at stored provider coordinates with supercluster count bubbles when zoomed out, search-as-I-move-the-map on by default; mobile uses a floating Map/List toggle. Map component from 21st search result mapcn MarkerContent, installed from mapcn.dev/r/map.json.",
    "Role-aware dashboard: white sidebar, cool neutral canvas, cobalt controls, grouped activity chart, portfolio donut, and property table. Buyer, Seller, and Landlord views use owner-scoped Supabase data with a clearly labeled public sample preview. Inspired by the requested 21st dashboard collection; existing shadcn primitives reused.",
    "Landlord redesign 2026-10-02: user-selected mint reference supersedes the shared shell for Landlord only. Horizontal navigation, pale mint canvas, rounded white shell, emerald gradient KPI band, real rental hero beside pale mint rental-income bars, then tenant/reminder/calendar panels. Existing Button and Lucide primitives reused with public 21st dashboard inspiration. Private owner CRUD and ledger data; sample preview clearly labeled.",
    "Landlord dashboard (2026-10-02): uses the shared buyer/seller shell (dash-sidebar + breadcrumb topbar, cobalt tokens) instead of its former mint top-nav frame. Sidebar: RENTAL PORTFOLIO (Overview, My rentals, Tenants, Transactions, Calendar, Analytics) and MARKETPLACE (Rental listings = marketplace for-rent homes with Add to my rentals import, Browse all rentals). KPI cards are white with tinted icon chips, matching the seller KPI row."
